  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cffc787734bb8394aa7536fcc8bde4cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1717842942}
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 1890783104}
  TypeSpeed: 2.6
  dialogue:
  - Ah! What a beautiful day to be a living marshmallow in Earth!
  - Ah!
  - Salutations Marshmallow Boy!
  - Um... Who are you?
  - I'm TuT Cookie! Full name is Tutorial Cookie but I've come to tell you of a fabled
    land called-
  - Oregon?!
  - Close, Marshmallow Land. I trust that a fellow marshmallow like you has heard
    of it before.
  - Marshmallow Land... EXISTS!?
  - Yes sir! The place that expands imagination beyond your mind
  - The place... To run away from it all!
  - So! You up for the job kid?!
  - Well, yes of course! I don't really know how to get there but I can manage mysel-
  - I'll come guide you, follow me!
  - Wait! Oh gosh darn-
